WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:04.751
What happens when you place DVD copies of
"It's a Wonderful Life" in the Clockworks?

00:00:04.751 --> 00:00:08.050
The first copy was placed in the machinery
on the setting "1:1."

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:11.469
The output was one DVD copy of the film "White
Christmas."

00:00:11.469 --> 00:00:16.500
The next DVD was input on the setting "Fine,"
and produced a DVD copy of "Home Alone."

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.109
The final DVD was placed in the Clockworks
on the setting "Very Fine."

00:00:20.109 --> 00:00:25.430
The output was a seemingly ordinary and identical
DVD copy of "It's a Wonderful Life."

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:28.800
However, when the film was screened for a
group of twelve D-Class personnel, they all

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:30.760
vanished as soon as the credits rolled.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:32.890
They returned 24 hours later.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:37.579
Six were dead, four had lost their memories,
and the remaining two that were lucid claimed

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:40.960
to have gone to a parallel universe where
no one recognized them.

